| 2 datasets | `python3 code/build_datasets.py $D/parsed $R/results/data_out` | `results/data_out/{mteb_eng,mteb_multi,helm_mmlu}.npz` (X, family keys, release time) |
| C0 audit | `python3 code/audit.py $D/parsed $R/results/data_out $R/results` | `datasets.csv`, `spectra.csv`, `audit_notes.json` |
