| main runs (C1-C3) | `python3 code/run_experiment.py <dataset> <split> <design> <n_draws> <n_part> <out.pkl> [--bias] [--extra] [--transform=identity\|logit] [--dedup=0.3] [--softimpute] [--quick]` | `results/raw/*.pkl`, `results/raw/robust/*.pkl` |
