| small-N panels | `python3 code/build_small_panels.py $D/parsed $R/results/data_out`; `python3 code/union_overlap.py $D/parsed $D/union_raw $R/results` (also writes `results/data_out/llm_union16.npz`); then `python3 code/run_experiment.py <helm_lite\|helm_capabilities\|llm_union16> grouped fixed 200 5 <out.pkl>` (the k grid is cut at N/2) | `results/raw/small/*.pkl`, `union_overlap.csv`, `union_match_audit_sample.csv` |
