| matrix-Chernoff check | `python3 code/bound_check.py $R/results/raw $R/results/data_out $R/results` | `bound_check.csv` |
| paired comparisons | `python3 code/paired_comparisons.py $R/results/raw $R/results` | `paired_comparisons.csv` |
| bias by strength, with simulation | `python3 code/bias_check.py $R/results/raw $R/results/data_out $R/results` | `bias_check.csv` |
